; water_trial.room - the water trials (docs/maps/README.md), Solstice's trials region, left to right.
; Tested by tests/scenes/world/rooms/trials/water_trial_test.gd. Base movement, a single jump.
;
; 1. The rising pool (design 03 section 6.5, "pocas sobem"): a stone tank with
;    pool water at rest (`~`) and its reach painted above it (`r`), and a log
;    afloat by the far wall. The passage high in the far wall is out of reach
;    from the floor, the tank's near wall and the log at rest. Chuva raises the
;    water to the reach and the log with it; Ivo steps off it into the passage.
;    The rest water is a hazard: a fall respawns him on the last ground he stood on.

; 2. The frozen wave (design 02 section 8.4, Combinado 2, A Onda Parada): a
;    pool before a stone wall seven cells taller than the shore. Vendaval
;    played at the shore's edge (col 29) facing the wall piles the water
;    against it; Congelar fixes the crest as a ramp to the wall's top.
;    Congelar too early freezes a low wave the wall is still out of reach
;    from. The ice thaws from the shore: step onto it soon after it sets.
; 3. The wall of water (design 02 section 8, Inverno Logico 2; user, 2026-10-08:
;    the raised floor): Redoma played at the bank's edge (col 55) holds the
;    pool's water out of its shell, and the water rises around it to the shell
;    reach painted above (`u`); Congelar fixes the raised water as a floor of
;    ice 56 px above the bank, from which the exit on the far wall is a jump.
;    The rain never raises this pool, and Congelar first leaves nothing to raise.

[room]
origin = 0, -16

